  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Port Management training USPA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">45 Ukrainian Sea and Port Authority professionals are offered Dutch expertise on finances, the landlord ports model, and maritime single window through three training modules. After the completion of the training for specialized port industry personnel, it is anticipated that their professional skills in the areas of maritime and inland waterways will be improved. That will enable them to apply the knowledge and experience gained during the training to their everyday operational activities in the ports. In the end, these trainings will enlarge the chances of Ukraine to become more competitive in the market of port services in the Black and Azov Sea areas and facilitate the development of inland waterway connections.</narrative>
  </description>
